# March of the Machines (Bot2, turn 2), then Mycosynth Lattice (Bot1, turn 7): the order of march-of-the-machines-after-
# mycosynth-lattice-... reversed. March alone makes the Moxes 0/0 artifact creatures that die at once and Sol Ring a 1/1,
# while the lands, no artifacts, stay lands (the positive control, turn 3). Once the Lattice is out, March's layer-4
# effect, though older, depends on the Lattice's and applies after it (CR 613.8a-b), so the outcome is the order-free one:
# every land is a 0/0 artifact creature and dies (Bot1's four Plains, Bot2's Island), March is a 4/4 artifact enchantment
# creature, the Lattice a 6/6 and Sol Ring 1/1. Applied in timestamp order alone, March would not reach the lands.

